         </CEL>
         <CEL STYLEID="s51">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Surface finish measurements to be obtained by contact stylus in accordance with ISO 3274. <BRK/><BRK/>General visual inspection.<BRK/><BRK/>Indications to be assessed visually at 30-40x magnification.</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="142.50">
